OL,3,GNEWSAWreckage warning after boat
OL,4,Acapsized at weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FMariners are being told to watch out
OL,7,Ffor wreckage after a boat capsized at
OL,8,Fthe weekend.
OL,10,FThe coastguard rescued three people
OL,11,Ffrom the sea near South Shields at
OL,12,Fabout 15:00 BST on Saturday after they
OL,13,Fcalled for help.
OL,15,FThe Port of Tyne said the 14ft (4.2m)
OL,16,Fcabin cruiser had been lost from sight
OL,17,Fand its current position and condition
OL,18,Fwas unknown.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,446,440,260,160,0,100
