OL,3,GNEWSAWreckage warning after boat
OL,4,Acapsized at weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is probable that the vessel has
OL,7,Fsunk; however, the possibility that it
OL,8,Fremains submerged or partially
OL,9,Fsubmerged cannot be excluded and may
OL,10,Ftherefore present a hazard to
OL,11,Fnavigation," a spokesperson said.
